# Approved literal inputs: every listed key is required; no extra keys or shell expansion.
# Quote values containing spaces. Never add SP_COMMIT: derived from clean HEAD.
# Derived driver flags: DEPLOYLIVE_REHEARSAL, DEPLOYLIVE_STOP_BEFORE_BOOTSTRAP,
# DEPLOYLIVE_POP_REQUEST_OUT and DEPLOYLIVE_EVM_VERSION are not operator inputs.
# GUARDIANS stays empty here: deploy reads evidence/guardians.hex after conversion.
# Paths are relative to the worktree except absolute FORGE and CAST_1_7_1 binaries.
# RPC credentials and optional private keys have no committed values. Do not commit the filled copy.
# Required production DEPLOYER_ACCOUNT is blank for rehearsal. REHEARSAL_* are only for the legacy scrubber.
# ENABLE_AGENT_REGISTRIES=0 requires empty AGENT_IDENTITY_REGISTRY / AGENT_REPUTATION_REGISTRY.
# Optional/derived; leave empty unless applicable.
AGENT_IDENTITY_REGISTRY=
# Optional/derived; leave empty unless applicable.
AGENT_REPUTATION_REGISTRY=
